\title{Why POGIL?}
\date{2026-08-28T13:25:28Z}
\tag{algorithms}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{Via [another activity](https://hendrix-cs.github.io/csci382/pub/why-POGIL.pdf), we learned about the two main aspects of [POGIL](https://pogil.org/):

\ul{
  \li{\em{Guided Inquiry Learning}: working in a team on an activity designed to guide you through a learning process.}
  \li{\em{Process-Oriented}: through the roles, the activities also help you develop \em{process skills} such as communication, critical thinking, information processing, and teamwork.}
}

}
